  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://minecraftonly.com/uploads/posts/2025-09/1757083236_meijun.png\" alt=\"Minecraft 1.16.5 Forge 最新方塊模組 » 第8頁 » MinecraftOnly\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">！白天，你只能獨自生存，但到了夜晚，它們（沒錯，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>它們</strong></span>）會生成，有些還會欺騙你！</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\">！牠速度很快，會殺死你，還能用假追擊來迷惑你！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>作者不樂見模型被盜用或重製成更好的版本，但若經我允許則可行。</em></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><strong>！！！警告：此模組使用自然生物生成機制，請勿關閉！！！<br>！！！警告2：此模組無法在多人模式或冒險模式中運作！！！</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>靈感來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-boiled-one-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">The Boiled One</span></strong></a> 模組</p><p>追逐主題曲由：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftuna.voicemod.net%252fsound%252f34fb6d93-14b0-4029-bbcc-352b0c9f75e6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FuwattiBlockman</strong></a> 提供</p><p>創作者：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://mcreator.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCreator</a>&nbsp;</span>+&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ilyahopal228/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ilyahopal228</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">劇透：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>生物：</p>\n<p>沸煮者、沸煮者潛行、沸煮者假追擊。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>學術自由授權條款（\"AFL\"）v.3.0 / 版權所有</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">the</span> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1606/273/639037048699128716.png\"></strong></p>",
